  m_Name: Object_271
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Right Intake Manifold Gasket
  description: The Right Intake Manifold Gasket is a tiny, thin-flat component located
    at the middle-right-front of the engine, sealing the intake manifold to prevent
    air and fuel leaks. Made of Material.006, this gasket is essential for maintaining
    the engine's performance and efficiency. An interesting detail about the Right
    Intake Manifold Gasket is that its position on the right side of the engine allows
    it to work in conjunction with the Center Intake Manifold Gasket to provide a
    secure seal around the intake manifold.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
